{"id":"c9c5c2b9ecd4e85b","group":"58","path":"58/batch19/58-df-fundamental-group.md","title":"Fundamental Group","display":"df-fundamental-group — Fundamental Group","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-fundamental-group","aliases":["58-df-fundamental-group"],"display":"df-fundamental-group — Fundamental Group","depends_on":["[[58-df-homotopy]]","[[58-df-loop]]","[[58-df-topological-space]]","[[58-df-function]]","[[58-df-group]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-fundamental-group"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-fundamental-group</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-fundamental-group — Fundamental Group"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"cc1ce993dd3ce56d\" href=\"?note=cc1ce993dd3ce56d\" title=\"58-df-homotopy\">58-df-homotopy</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"7bc072a211934ba8\" href=\"?note=7bc072a211934ba8\" title=\"58-df-loop\">58-df-loop</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"815e63e5071e7b58\" href=\"?note=815e63e5071e7b58\" title=\"58-df-topological-space\">58-df-topological-space</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"ed71f39f59370734\" href=\"?note=ed71f39f59370734\" title=\"58-df-group\">58-df-group</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\tau_X,m,\\gamma\\in V\">\\(X,\\tau_X,m,\\gamma\\in V\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x_0\\in X\">\\(x_0\\in X\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Omega(X,\\tau_X,x_0)\">\\(\\Omega(X,\\tau_X,x_0)\\)</span> (based-loop set)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Loop}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Loop}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BasedHomotopic}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{BasedHomotopic}_S\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Concat}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Concat}_S\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"7bc072a211934ba8\" href=\"?note=7bc072a211934ba8\" title=\"58-df-loop\">58-df-loop</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"815e63e5071e7b58\" href=\"?note=815e63e5071e7b58\" title=\"58-df-topological-space\">58-df-topological-space</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Group}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Group}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a>, <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"ed71f39f59370734\" href=\"?note=ed71f39f59370734\" title=\"58-df-group\">58-df-group</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LoopClass}_{X,\\tau_X,x_0}:V\\to V\">\\(\\mathrm{LoopClass}_{X,\\tau_X,x_0}:V\\to V\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi_1:V^3\\to V\">\\(\\pi_1:V^3\\to V\\)</span> (class and carrier operators defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FundamentalGroupOperation}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{FundamentalGroupOperation}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (predicate for the induced multiplication)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}fundamental\\text{-}group} \\vdash \\Omega(X,\\tau_X,x_0)\\coloneqq\\{\\gamma\\in X^{[0,1]}\\mid\\mathrm{Loop}_S(\\gamma,X,\\tau_X,x_0)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}fundamental\\text{-}group} \\vdash \\Omega(X,\\tau_X,x_0)\\coloneqq\\{\\gamma\\in X^{[0,1]}\\mid\\mathrm{Loop}_S(\\gamma,X,\\tau_X,x_0)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}fundamental\\text{-}group\\text{-}class} \\vdash \\mathrm{LoopClass}_{X,\\tau_X,x_0}(\\gamma)\\coloneqq\\{\\eta\\in\\Omega(X,\\tau_X,x_0)\\mid\\mathrm{BasedHomotopic}_S(\\gamma,\\eta,X,\\tau_X,x_0)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}fundamental\\text{-}group\\text{-}class} \\vdash \\mathrm{LoopClass}_{X,\\tau_X,x_0}(\\gamma)\\coloneqq\\{\\eta\\in\\Omega(X,\\tau_X,x_0)\\mid\\mathrm{BasedHomotopic}_S(\\gamma,\\eta,X,\\tau_X,x_0)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}fundamental\\text{-}group\\text{-}carrier} \\vdash \\pi_1(X,\\tau_X,x_0)\\coloneqq\\{\\mathrm{LoopClass}_{X,\\tau_X,x_0}(\\gamma)\\mid\\gamma\\in\\Omega(X,\\tau_X,x_0)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}fundamental\\text{-}group\\text{-}carrier} \\vdash \\pi_1(X,\\tau_X,x_0)\\coloneqq\\{\\mathrm{LoopClass}_{X,\\tau_X,x_0}(\\gamma)\\mid\\gamma\\in\\Omega(X,\\tau_X,x_0)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}fundamental\\text{-}group\\text{-}operation}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{FundamentalGroupOperation}_S(m,X,\\tau_X,x_0)\\leftrightarrow{}\\\\\n&amp;\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau_X)\\land x_0\\in X\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}\\bigl(m,\\pi_1(X,\\tau_X,x_0)\\times\\pi_1(X,\\tau_X,x_0),\\pi_1(X,\\tau_X,x_0)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Group}_S\\bigl(\\pi_1(X,\\tau_X,x_0),m\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\gamma,\\eta\\in\\Omega(X,\\tau_X,x_0)\\;\\exists\\delta\\in\\Omega(X,\\tau_X,x_0)\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Concat}_S(\\gamma,\\eta,\\delta,X,\\tau_X,x_0)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{112pt}\\land m\\bigl(\\langle\\mathrm{LoopClass}_{X,\\tau_X,x_0}(\\gamma),\\mathrm{LoopClass}_{X,\\tau_X,x_0}(\\eta)\\rangle\\bigr)\n=\\mathrm{LoopClass}_{X,\\tau_X,x_0}(\\delta)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}fundamental\\text{-}group\\text{-}operation}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{FundamentalGroupOperation}_S(m,X,\\tau_X,x_0)\\leftrightarrow{}\\\\\n&amp;\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau_X)\\land x_0\\in X\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}\\bigl(m,\\pi_1(X,\\tau_X,x_0)\\times\\pi_1(X,\\tau_X,x_0),\\pi_1(X,\\tau_X,x_0)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Group}_S\\bigl(\\pi_1(X,\\tau_X,x_0),m\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\gamma,\\eta\\in\\Omega(X,\\tau_X,x_0)\\;\\exists\\delta\\in\\Omega(X,\\tau_X,x_0)\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Concat}_S(\\gamma,\\eta,\\delta,X,\\tau_X,x_0)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{112pt}\\land m\\bigl(\\langle\\mathrm{LoopClass}_{X,\\tau_X,x_0}(\\gamma),\\mathrm{LoopClass}_{X,\\tau_X,x_0}(\\eta)\\rangle\\bigr)\n=\\mathrm{LoopClass}_{X,\\tau_X,x_0}(\\delta)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}fundamental\\text{-}group\\text{-}operation\\text{-}exists\\text{-}unique}\\vdash \\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau_X)\\land x_0\\in X\\to\\exists!m\\in V\\;\\mathrm{FundamentalGroupOperation}_S(m,X,\\tau_X,x_0)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}fundamental\\text{-}group\\text{-}operation\\text{-}exists\\text{-}unique}\\vdash \\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau_X)\\land x_0\\in X\\to\\exists!m\\in V\\;\\mathrm{FundamentalGroupOperation}_S(m,X,\\tau_X,x_0)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The carrier is an explicit set of based-homotopy classes; a relation predicate is no longer placed syntactically in a quotient denominator.</li>\n<li>Reflexivity, symmetry and transitivity of based homotopy, compatibility with concatenation, and the group laws are the standard theorems that justify the final existence-and-uniqueness assertion.</li>\n<li>It is the first homotopy group and is invariant under pointed homotopy equivalence.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-homotopy","status":"resolved","id":"cc1ce993dd3ce56d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-homotopy]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-loop","status":"resolved","id":"7bc072a211934ba8","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-loop]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-topological-space","status":"resolved","id":"815e63e5071e7b58","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-topological-space]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-group","status":"resolved","id":"ed71f39f59370734","anchor":"r